- &lt;/TimeSpan&gt;
- &lt;Polygon&gt;
- &lt;altitudeMode&gt;clampToGround&lt;/altitudeMode&gt;
- &lt;outerBoundaryIs&gt;
- &lt;LinearRing&gt;
- &lt;coordinates&gt;18.452787460,40.85553626,017.2223187,40.589098,....0 17.2223,39.783
- &lt;/coordinates&gt;
- &lt;/LinearRing&gt;
- &lt;/outerBoundaryIs&gt;
- &lt;/Polygon&gt;
- &lt;/Placemark&gt; (E95) time is expressed in terms of the proleptic Gregorian Calendar (SP11).

In First Order Logic:
- Q17 (x,y) ⇒ SP7 (x)
- Q17 (x,y) ⇒ SP11 (y)
</rdfs:comment>
